'''Mummy''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2017|2017 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
Its blade is pale in color with a wooden texture over it. The guard and handle are a vintage gold color. However, the bottom portion of the handle features a red meandering pattern, or a Greek fret.

